  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. They do enjoy gentle breezes, though.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can be carried away on even the gentlest breeze. It may even float all the way to the next town.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, HOPPIP links its leaves with other HOPPIP to prepare against being blown away.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
